OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIncreasingly cloudy with rain,
OL,6,Fheavy and perhaps thundery for a time,
OL,7,Fwith gusty winds. Strong winds
OL,8,Faffecting coasts in the afternoon.
OL,9,FImproving weather conditions during
OL,10,Fthe afternoon with rain clearing.
OL,11,FCloud breaking with some sunshine and
OL,12,Fwinds easing later.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FA clear night for much of the
OL,15,Fregion, and with light winds
OL,16,Ftemperatures will quickly fall, with a
OL,17,Fchance of a frost in rural areas. Some
OL,18,Fcloud arriving later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
