OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FFine and bright on Thursday,
OL,6,Fafter a chilly start. A lot of
OL,7,Fsunshine, probably hazy, with the
OL,8,Fgreatest chance of any thicker cloud
OL,9,Faffecting Yorkshire. Feeling warmer by
OL,10,Fafternoon.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FGenerally
OL,13,Fdry and settled on Friday but
OL,14,Fcloudier. Chance of rain later. Dry
OL,15,Fand brighter over the weekend with
OL,16,Fsome sunny or clear spells.
OL,17,FTemperatures near or rather above
OL,18,Fnormal.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
